# SPA fallback and API proxy, shipped inside the build output.
#
# This file exists instead of `rewrites` in vercel.json because Vercel applied the
# `headers` rules from that file but silently dropped the whole `rewrites` array —
# `/dashboard` answered 404 and `/api/health/` returned Vercel's own NOT_FOUND
# (`X-Vercel-Error`) rather than reaching Render. Rules here are matched in order,
# so the two proxies must stay above the catch-all, and 200 means "rewrite", not
# "redirect": the browser keeps the URL it asked for.
/api/* https://codeher-api.onrender.com/api/:splat 200
/media/* https://codeher-api.onrender.com/media/:splat 200
/* /index.html 200
